  "ruleText": "Rev 203.06 Replies to Motions. Unless otherwise specifically ordered by the presiding officer pursuant to Rev 201.07, replies to motions shall be filed within 10 days after the filing of the motion.\n\nSource. #6749, eff 5-19-98, EXPIRED: 5-19-06\n\nNew. #8658-A, eff 6-13-06; ss by #11185-A, eff 9-20-16",
